OL,3,ATrump, Putin and Xi plan historic joint
OL,4,Ameeting in China next week, White House
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin and Xi
OL,8,FJinping are planning to meet on the
OL,9,Fsidelines of a summit in China next
OL,10,Fweek, the White House has said.
OL,12,FThe historic meeting between the
OL,13,Fleaders of the US, Russia and China
OL,14,Fwill take place as Trump attends the
OL,15,FAsia-Pacific Economic Cooperation
OL,16,F(Apec) summit in the southern city of
OL,17,FShenzhen, spokeswoman Olivia Wales told
OL,18,Freporters.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
